[\fB\-\-speed\fR \fIN\fR] [\fB\-\-countdown\fR \fISEC\fR] [\fB\-\-timeout\fR \fISEC\fR]
[\fB\-\-dry-run\fR] [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-\-log-level\fR \fILEVEL\fR]
.br
.B crossmacro
.B move|click|down|up|scroll|key|tap|type|delay
... [\fB\-\-dry-run\fR] [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-\-log-level\fR \fILEVEL\fR]
